Deep in the desert ahead of here,
at the Desert Resort,{VAR BE00}
there are some ruins that have{VAR BE00}
become a little tourist destination!

Cheren: Hey, {VAR 0100 0000}.{VAR BE01}
I've been waiting for you to get
the Insect Badge.{VAR BE01}
And now it's time to see which one of us
is the stronger Trainer!{VAR BE01}

Cheren: It's now clear to me.{VAR BE01}
The reason you are so tough is the trust
between you and your Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
But...that shouldn't be a problem.{VAR BE01}
I can get more out of {VAR 0101 0000}
and my other Pokémon, too.{VAR BE01}

Oh! Trainer, take a look at the sand.{VAR BE01}
Do you see how some areas are lighter?
And some of the sand looks...darker...{VAR BE01}
Pokémon are hiding in the darker sand!

entries.text:
Trainer Tips!{VAR BE01}

Pokémon have a source of energy
for using moves.{VAR BE01}
It's called PP, meaning Power Points.
They have PP for each move.{VAR BE01}
When a move has no PP remaining,
that Pokémon cannot use that move.{VAR BE01}
That's a good time to head for
the Pokémon Center!
